# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Sina Stocker et al. (2022). How robust are modern graph neural network potentials in long and hot molecular dynamics simulations?.
#   Machine Learning Science and Technology. doi:10.1088/2632-2153/ac9955
#
# Version read: publisher (sha256 9b00964c483686a7...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 93 (Method/model). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: the GemNet-Q potentials trained on QM7-x subsets of
# 3.2 k, 32 k, 320 k and 3.2 million configurations and tested for
# robustness in 280 ns of MD at 300 K and above, with re-labelled MD
# samples. The test-set force MAE of the largest model is the one value
# printed in the text.

