###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Learning curves (Fig. 1) and the errors on MD samples as a function of temperature and training-set size (Fig. 2) are figures; only the force MAE of the 3.2-million model is printed (the text adds an energy error of about 0.01 eV without saying for which model, so it is not encoded).
# - GemNet-T, SchNet and DimeNet++ models are also trained on QM7-x for the learning curves; they are not encoded because no number is printed for them.
